apt-snapshot-guard (1.0.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * DPkg::Pre-Invoke hook forces a Timeshift snapshot before apt applies any
    package change (install, reinstall, remove, purge, upgrade, full-upgrade,
    autoremove), covering apt/apt-get, aptdaemon (GUI updater / PackageKit)
    and unattended-upgrades.
  * Fail-open by default with a STRICT fail-closed mode; per-transaction
    dedupe window; snapshot lock; configurable via /etc/apt-snapshot-guard/config.

